        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "竟然 presents a fact as contrary to expectation. The event occurred; the surprise belongs to the speaker's evaluation.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他竟然忘了。",
                "pinyin": "tā jìngrán wàng le 。",
                "meaning": "Surprisingly, he forgot.",
                "audio": "3c43b7222e262900c9a923e0cfb79d92baf695d3285cbb23d9dda32a8dbce30f"
              },
              {
                "text": "这里竟然没有人。",
                "pinyin": "zhèlǐ jìngrán méiyǒu rén 。",
                "meaning": "Unexpectedly, there is nobody here.",
                "audio": "49f9b8b34885efdd1967afb3f8d6aea2ece77362946c5b61af4fecd40654f862"
              }
